    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Upon arrival at Rio de Janeiro International Airport, meet your local guide and enjoy a private transfer to your hotel. The rest of the day is at leisure to relax after your journey or begin exploring the vibrant atmosphere of Rio de Janeiro at your own pace.\n\nOptional evening experience, at an additional cost: the Rio by Night show with dinner (see Optional excursions).",
