    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "After breakfast, a half-day excursion to one of Rio de Janeiro’s most famous landmarks. The tour begins with a cable car ride to Sugar Loaf Mountain, stopping first at Urca Hill before continuing to the summit. From the top, enjoy spectacular panoramic views of Guanabara Bay, Copacabana Beach, the surrounding mountains, the islands scattered along the coast, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and the iconic statue of Christ the Redeemer in the distance.\n\nThe excursion continues through the historic centre of Rio de Janeiro, with its colonial buildings, churches and monasteries and the impressive Metropolitan Cathedral, revealing the city’s rich history and cultural heritage. The rest of the afternoon is at leisure: relax on the beach, stroll along the famous promenades of Copacabana or Ipanema, or simply soak up the vibrant atmosphere of the Marvellous City.",
      "sourceTextHash": "sha256:323f0c5f400dfc736886f0adc1c45d32d0a6d9bf41ee8f944c02d2d1a53e5c4b",
      "dependencyHashes": {},
