    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, a half-day excursion (4 hours) through the lush Tijuca Forest, one of the largest urban forests in the world, home to an extraordinary variety of tropical flora and fauna, to the summit of Corcovado Mountain, where the magnificent Christ the Redeemer overlooks the city. Named one of the New Seven Wonders of the World, the monument offers breathtaking panoramic views of Rio de Janeiro, its famous beaches, mountains and Guanabara Bay. Optional afternoon experience, at an additional cost: a private tour of Rocinha (see Optional excursions).",
      "sourceTextHash": "sha256:4f0e2fdde7121d4e4e3da4ed537214371f6d902d13b725f5217fbc51a07e93e8",
      "dependencyHashes": {},
